      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "retention_rate = retained_accounts / cycle_rows -- cumulative\nsurvival, counting skipped and paused accounts as retained.\nmonthly_churn_rate = churned_accounts / accounts that entered\nthe cycle ALIVE.",
      "originalText": "retention_rate = retained_accounts / cycle_rows -- cumulative\nsurvival, counting skipped and paused accounts as retained.\nmonthly_churn_rate = churned_accounts / accounts that entered\nthe cycle ALIVE.",
