      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "starting + new + expansion - contraction - churned = ending,\ncomputed on subscription VALUE at the tier in force rather\nthan on cash billed. Deferred billings are published beside\nthe bridge, never inside it.",
      "originalText": "starting + new + expansion - contraction - churned = ending,\ncomputed on subscription VALUE at the tier in force rather\nthan on cash billed. Deferred billings are published beside\nthe bridge, never inside it.",
